전력이 7200V, 단자 전압이 6500V, 동기 리액\n\n턴스가 15Ω, 상차각이 30°인 비돌극형 3상 동기 발전\n\n기의 출력은 몇 kW인가?\n\n\n① 4680         ② 4980\n\n③ 5280         ④ 5580\n\n⑤ 5760","source":{"collection":"2024h1","collectionLabel":"2024 상반기","examLabel":"24.05.19 한국가스기술공사 (사람인)","originalId":"2024h1-e16-m21","number":21},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e16-m21-q.webp","width":696,"height":643},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e16-m21-e1.webp","width":678,"height":1841}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P037-S1-Q22","number":22,"question":"24.05.19 한국가스기술공사 (사람인) · 객관식 22번","searchText":" 22\n\n다음 내용의 빈 칸에 알맞은 말은?\n\n  동기발전기의 병렬운전에서 각 발전기의 기전력\n\n  파형이 다르면 (    ㉠      )가 발생하고,\n\n  위상이 다르면 (    ㉡      )가 발생한다.\n\n\n        ㉠           ㉡\n\n ①   무효 순환전류     유효 순환전류\n\n ②   무효 순환전류      동기화 전류\n\n ③  고조파 무효순환전류    무효 순환전류\n\n ④  고조파 무효순환전류    유효 순환전류\n\n ⑤  고조파 무효순환전류      난조","source":{"collection":"2024h1","collectionLabel":"2024 상반기","examLabel":"24.05.19 한국가스기술공사 (사람인)","originalId":"2024h1-e16-m22","number":22},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e16-m22-q.webp","width":696,"height":637},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e16-m22-e1.webp","width":696,"height":1137}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P037-S1-Q23","number":23,"question":"24.05.19 한국가스기술공사 (사람인) · 객관식 23번","searchText":" 23\n\n변압기의 %저항강하가 4.5, %리액턴스 강하가 12\n\n일 때, 뒤진역률 80인 경우의 전압변동률은 몇 인\n\n가?\n\n\n① 6.8          ② 8.8\n\n③ 10.8             ④ 12.8\n\n⑤ 14.8","source":{"collection":"2024h1","collectionLabel":"2024 상반기","examLabel":"24.05.19 한국가스기술공사 (사람인)","originalId":"2024h1-e16-m23","number":23},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e16-m23-q.webp","width":678,"height":603},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e16-m23-e1.webp","width":696,"height":745}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P037-S1-Q24","number":24,"question":"24.05.19 한국가스기술공사 (사람인) · 객관식 24번","searchText":" 24\n\n변압기의 병렬운전이 가능한 결선조합을 모두 고른 것은?\n\n  ㉠ △-△, Y-Y      ㉡ △-△, △-△\n\n  ㉢ △-Y,  Y-Y     ㉣ △-Y,  △-Y\n\n\n\n① ㉠㉡㉢        ② ㉠㉡㉣\n\n③ ㉠㉢㉣        ④ ㉡㉢㉣\n\n⑤ ㉠㉡㉢㉣","source":{"collection":"2024h1","collectionLabel":"2024 상반기","examLabel":"24.05.19 한국가스기술공사 (사람인)","originalId":"2024h1-e16-m24","number":24},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e16-m24-q.webp","width":678,"height":686},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e16-m24-e1.webp","width":678,"height":771}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P037-S1-Q25","number":25,"question":"24.05.19 한국가스기술공사 (사람인) · 객관식 25번","searchText":" 25\n\n50Hz, 10극의 3상 유도전동기가 516rpm으로 회전하\n\n고 있을 때, 유도전동기의 회전자 주파수는 몇 Hz인가?\n\n\n① 5           ② 6\n\n③ 7           ④ 8\n\n⑤ 9","source":{"collection":"2024h1","collectionLabel":"2024 상반기","examLabel"